      "message": "feat(pages): physical category pages, dead-link validation, and live smoke-test\n\nAdd physical static pages for every knowledge category (findings, evidence,\nrepositories, commits, PRs, issues, timeline, phases, decisions, suggestions,\nfiles, map, contributions) so production URLs return HTTP 200 instead of 404.\n\nWire window.IX_VIEW in sections.js to render SPA views on category pages.\nConvert root sidebar category buttons to physical links. Add KNOWLEDGE\nCATEGORIES grid to overview. Fix entity index relative-link generation\n(double-directory prefix for section/issue entities).\n\nAdd dead-link and placeholder token checks to validate-public.mjs. Add\nverify-live.mjs production smoke-test script and a verify job after Pages\ndeploy in the workflow.",
